{
 "what": "bench/compare.cpp of f688794 with probe arms, built outside the tree against a copy of include/ of f688794 with three additions: schema<T>::verify (decode_cursor::value_read without its output: every check of the verified decode, no allocation), and the macro PROBE_NOOWNER, which removes from accessor::at_path the moved-from check and the copy of the owner into each accessor it gives. Arms on carsales (DS_CARS) and records (DS_RECORDS): MB_FIELD, MB_FIELD_UNVERIFIED (+_AA, A/A), MB_FIELD_UNVERIFIED+NOOWNER, MB_OPEN (unverified_path only), MB_FIELD_HELD (at_path on an accessor opened once), MB_FIELD_VU (verify then unverified field), MB_FIELD_WU (cbor::item_size over the message then unverified field), FB_FIELD, FB_FIELD_V, MB_READ, MB_READ_UNVERIFIED, MB_READ_UNVERIFIED+NOOWNER, MB_READ_VU, MB_READ_WU, FB_READ, FB_READ_V, MB_VERIFY, MB_WELLFORMED (item_size only), FB_VERIFY (Verifier only). One binary per arm and data set, 5 rounds, every binary once per round in shuffled order, 1 s min_time.",
